{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Roue Libre",
  "metadata": {
    "roue-libre:comment": [
      "Base map style — SPEC.md §4.2 and §7.",
      "",
      "Everything between double braces is replaced at load time: the colours",
      "come from the tokens in res/values/colors.xml, and the path to the",
      "tiles is only known at run time, since the file is installed in the",
      "application's private storage.",
      "",
      "No remote URL. The tiles are read from disk and the glyphs live in the",
      "APK: drawing the map sends no request out (§2, C3).",
      "",
      "No sprite sheet: markers are drawn as circles rather than icons. It is",
      "plainer, and it avoids embedding a sheet of images for a handful of",
      "symbols.",
      "",
      "The map stays scenery, not subject (§7): no layer here carries a",
      "saturated hue except the cycle ways, which are the one piece of scenery a",
      "bike application cannot treat as scenery. What separates the layers from",
      "one another is VALUE — how light or dark each one is — because value is",
      "what survives a screen read in full sunlight, and because spreading the",
      "values apart costs no saturation at all.",
      "",
      "Every road is drawn twice, a casing then a fill. On a pale ground a white",
      "road is invisible on its own: it is its casing that draws the line, and",
      "the fill only hollows it out. Removing a casing removes the road.",
      "",
      "The layers below use tags the tiles already carry (tools/map_features.yaml",
      "keepTags): highway, railway, leisure, landuse, natural, name. Telling",
      "cycle ways from streets, woods from mown grass, or trams from trains costs",
      "no extra byte in the tile file — only a filter here.",
      "",
      "Bus lanes a bicycle may share were drawn here too, in the same green, and",
      "taken back out. The line was where the clutter came from, not the colour:",
      "on a boulevard already carrying its carriageway, its footway and its cycle",
      "way, a fourth stroke turned the road into a bundle of parallel lines. The",
      "cycle ways stayed, because they are the point of the application; the",
      "lanes merely shared with buses were not worth what they cost to read."
    ]
  },
  "glyphs": "asset://glyphs/{fontstack}/{range}.pbf",
  "sources": {
    "vector": {
      "type": "vector",
      "url": "mbtiles://{{tilesPath}}"
    }
  },
  "layers": [
    {
      "id": "background",
      "type": "background",
      "paint": { "background-color": "{{map_land}}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "greenery",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "landcover",
      "filter": [
        "!",
        ["in", ["get", "natural"], ["literal", ["wood", "scrub", "heath"]]]
      ],
      "paint": { "fill-color": "{{map_greenery}}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "woods",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "landcover",
      "filter": [
        "any",
        ["in", ["get", "natural"], ["literal", ["wood", "scrub", "heath"]]],
        ["==", ["get", "landuse"], "forest"]
      ],
      "paint": { "fill-color": "{{map_wood}}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "water",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "water",
      "paint": { "fill-color": "{{map_water}}" }
    },
    {
      "id": "waterways",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "waterway",
      "layout": { "line-cap": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_water}}",
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          12,
          ["match", ["get", "waterway"], "stream", 0.6, 1.4],
          16,
          ["match", ["get", "waterway"], "stream", 2, 6]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "municipal-boundaries",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "boundary",
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_boundary}}",
        "line-width": 1,
        "line-dasharray": [3, 3]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "buildings",
      "type": "fill",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "building",
      "minzoom": 15,
      "paint": {
        "fill-color": "{{map_building}}",
        "fill-outline-color": "{{map_building_edge}}",
        "fill-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 15, 0, 15.4, 1]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "paths",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_minor",
      "minzoom": 14,
      "filter": [
        "in",
        ["get", "highway"],
        ["literal", ["footway", "path", "steps", "track"]]
      ],
      "layout": { "line-cap": "butt" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_path}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 14, 0.8, 16, 1.6],
        "line-dasharray": [1, 2]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "minor-roads-casing",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_minor",
      "minzoom": 13,
      "filter": [
        "!",
        [
          "in",
          ["get", "highway"],
          ["literal", ["footway", "path", "steps", "track", "cycleway"]]
        ]
      ],
      "layout": { "line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_road_minor_edge}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 13, 1.4, 16, 8]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "minor-roads",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_minor",
      "minzoom": 13.6,
      "filter": [
        "!",
        [
          "in",
          ["get", "highway"],
          ["literal", ["footway", "path", "steps", "track", "cycleway"]]
        ]
      ],
      "layout": { "line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_road_minor}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 13.6, 0.4, 16, 5.4]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "major-roads-casing",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_major",
      "layout": { "line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_road_major_edge}}",
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          10,
          [
            "match",
            ["get", "highway"],
            ["motorway", "trunk"],
            2.2,
            ["primary"],
            1.8,
            1.3
          ],
          16,
          [
            "match",
            ["get", "highway"],
            ["motorway", "trunk"],
            15,
            ["primary"],
            13,
            10
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "major-roads",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_major",
      "layout": { "line-cap": "round", "line-join": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_road_major}}",
        "line-width": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          10,
          [
            "match",
            ["get", "highway"],
            ["motorway", "trunk"],
            1.1,
            ["primary"],
            0.8,
            0.5
          ],
          16,
          [
            "match",
            ["get", "highway"],
            ["motorway", "trunk"],
            11.5,
            ["primary"],
            9.5,
            7
          ]
        ],
        "line-opacity": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 10, 0.5, 12, 1]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cycleways",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_minor",
      "minzoom": 13,
      "filter": ["==", ["get", "highway"], "cycleway"],
      "layout": { "line-cap": "butt", "line-join": "round" },
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_cycleway}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 13, 1, 16, 2.6],
        "line-dasharray": [3, 2]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "railways",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "railway",
      "filter": [
        "in",
        ["get", "railway"],
        ["literal", ["rail", "narrow_gauge"]]
      ],
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_rail}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 11, 0.7, 16, 2.4],
        "line-dasharray": [4, 3]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tramways",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "railway",
      "minzoom": 12,
      "filter": [
        "in",
        ["get", "railway"],
        ["literal", ["tram", "subway", "light_rail"]]
      ],
      "paint": {
        "line-color": "{{map_rail}}",
        "line-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 12, 0.5, 16, 1.6],
        "line-dasharray": [2, 2]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bus-stops",
      "type": "circle",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "busstop",
      "minzoom": 15,
      "paint": {
        "circle-radius": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 15, 1.2, 16, 2],
        "circle-color": "{{map_marker_minor}}",
        "circle-opacity": 0.7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "landmarks",
      "type": "circle",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "poi",
      "minzoom": 13.5,
      "paint": {
        "circle-radius": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 13.5, 2, 16, 3.2],
        "circle-color": "{{map_marker_minor}}",
        "circle-stroke-width": 1,
        "circle-stroke-color": "{{map_label_halo}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "transit",
      "type": "circle",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "transit",
      "paint": {
        "circle-radius": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 10, 1.8, 16, 4.5],
        "circle-color": "{{map_label_strong}}",
        "circle-stroke-width": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 12, 0, 14, 1.5],
        "circle-stroke-color": "{{map_label_halo}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "waterway-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "waterway",
      "minzoom": 13,
      "filter": ["has", "name"],
      "layout": {
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": 11,
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.08,
        "text-max-angle": 35,
        "symbol-spacing": 400
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_water_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "greenery-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "landcover",
      "minzoom": 13.5,
      "filter": ["has", "name"],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": 11,
        "text-max-width": 8,
        "text-optional": true
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_greenery_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "street-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_minor",
      "minzoom": 14.5,
      "filter": [
        "all",
        ["has", "name"],
        [
          "!",
          [
            "in",
            ["get", "highway"],
            ["literal", ["footway", "path", "steps", "track"]]
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "layout": {
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": 11,
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.02,
        "text-max-angle": 35,
        "symbol-spacing": 260
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "road-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "road_major",
      "minzoom": 12,
      "filter": ["has", "name"],
      "layout": {
        "symbol-placement": "line",
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": ["interpolate", ["linear"], ["zoom"], 12, 10.5, 15, 12.5],
        "text-max-angle": 35,
        "symbol-spacing": 300
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "transit-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "transit",
      "minzoom": 13,
      "filter": ["has", "name"],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": 11,
        "text-anchor": "left",
        "text-offset": [0.7, 0],
        "text-optional": true
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "landmark-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "poi",
      "minzoom": 14.5,
      "filter": ["has", "name"],
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Regular"],
        "text-size": 10.5,
        "text-anchor": "top",
        "text-offset": [0, 0.5],
        "text-max-width": 8,
        "text-optional": true
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_label}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "municipality-labels",
      "type": "symbol",
      "source": "vector",
      "source-layer": "place",
      "layout": {
        "text-field": ["get", "name"],
        "text-font": ["Atkinson Hyperlegible Bold"],
        "text-size": [
          "interpolate",
          ["linear"],
          ["zoom"],
          10,
          ["case", ["==", ["get", "place"], "city"], 14, 10],
          14,
          ["case", ["==", ["get", "place"], "city"], 20, 13]
        ],
        "text-letter-spacing": 0.06,
        "text-max-width": 9,
        "text-transform": "uppercase"
      },
      "paint": {
        "text-color": "{{map_label_strong}}",
        "text-halo-color": "{{map_label_halo}}",
        "text-halo-width": 1.8
      }
    }
  ]
}
